AI Study Assistant is a Flutter-based mobile application designed to help students learn more efficiently using Artificial Intelligence. The application provides a personalized learning environment where students can interact with an AI tutor, upload study materials, generate summaries, create multiple-choice questions, and ask questions related to their subjects. The system uses AI APIs to analyze learning content and provide relevant, easy-to-understand responses.

The application includes features such as user authentication, AI-powered chat, document/notes upload, automatic summarization, quiz generation, flashcard creation, and study progress tracking. Students can use the AI assistant to clarify concepts, revise important topics, and practice questions without depending entirely on traditional study resources. A backend database can be used to securely store user profiles, study materials, generated content, and learning progress.

The project is developed using Flutter and Dart for the frontend, with technologies such as Firebase or a REST API backend, cloud storage, and an AI API for intelligent features. The main objective of the project is to combine mobile application development and artificial intelligence to create a personalized, interactive, and accessible study companion for students.
